---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const updated = "2026-09-24";
---

<Base
  title="privacy"
  description="plug has no server. your jobs, contacts and emails live in your own Google account, and nothing sends without you clicking send."
>
  <section>
    <h1>privacy</h1>
    <p class="muted">last updated {updated}</p>

    <p class="lede">
      plug has no server and no database. there is nowhere for us to keep your data,
      because we never receive it.
    </p>

    <h2>what the extension reads</h2>
    <p>
      when you click <strong>capture</strong> on a job posting, the extension reads that
      page once: company, role, location, the job description and the url. it reads
      nothing until you click, and it reads nothing on any other tab.
    </p>

    <h2>where it goes</h2>
    <p>
      captured jobs are stored in your browser (<code>chrome.storage.local</code>) and, if
      you set up the backend, written to a Google Sheet in <em>your</em> Google Drive,
      through a Google Apps Script project that <em>you</em> deploy and own. we have no
      access to either.
    </p>

    <h2>email</h2>
    <p>
      drafts are generated by Google's Gemini API, called from your own Apps Script
      project using your own API key. emails send from your Gmail, via your own
      authorisation, and only after you click send. replies arrive in your inbox.
    </p>

    <h2>linkedin</h2>
    <p>
      plug reads pages you are already looking at in order to rank possible contacts. it
      never sends a message, never sends a connection request, and never acts as you. it
      can pre-fill a note for you to send yourself.
    </p>

    <h2>what we collect</h2>
    <p>
      nothing. no accounts, no analytics inside the extension, no telemetry, no ad
      trackers. this website uses privacy-preserving analytics that set no cookies and
      record no personal data.
    </p>

    <h2>deleting your data</h2>
    <p>
      uninstall the extension to clear its local storage. delete the Google Sheet and the
      Apps Script project to remove the rest. nothing survives elsewhere.
    </p>

    <h2>contact</h2>
    <p>open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/alamzia23/job-referral-agent">the repo</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
